WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.932
In the Tang dynasty there was an emperor who reigned for a very long time — Emperor Xuanzong. In his later years, he met the beautiful and clever Yang Guifei.

00:00:11.282 --> 00:00:19.145
Yang Guifei was not only beautiful, she was also skilled in music and dance; she won Emperor Xuanzong's deep favor, and everyone in the palace envied her.

00:00:19.495 --> 00:00:29.541
The court often held banquets; Yang Guifei would perform a beautiful dance, and the emperor himself played music to accompany her.

00:00:29.891 --> 00:00:37.576
In their era the city of Chang'an was very prosperous; palace life was like a beautiful dream that everyone longed for.

00:00:37.926 --> 00:00:40.881
The streets were full of people coming and going, and the shops were bustling with life.

00:00:41.231 --> 00:00:49.038
Sadly, the good times did not last: the An Lushan Rebellion broke out, they were forced to leave Chang'an, and the beautiful dream awoke.

00:00:49.388 --> 00:00:57.718
Later, Bai Juyi wrote the Song of Everlasting Regret, passing this love story down for a thousand years — people still read it today.

00:00:58.068 --> 00:01:01.951
This long poem has moved countless readers and has been handed down to this day.

